questions.question:
Consider this pseudocode:

function processRefund(amount, isPremiumMember) {
  let fee = 10;                     // statement 1
  if (isPremiumMember) {            // decision
    fee = 0;                        // statement 2
  }
  processPayment(amount - fee);     // statement 3
}

A test suite consists of exactly one test case: processRefund(100, true). What statement coverage and branch coverage does this single test case achieve?
